r New&#39;,monospace;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">);</span>.  I&#39;m not sure how to translate this into something which R will use with the addControl() function.  Or perhaps I am just barking up the wrong tree?</div><div><br></div><div>A scale bar seems a fairly generic feature so presumably someone out there has managed to get it to work?  I&#39;ll look forward to hearing from you!</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks,</div><div><br></div><div>Tom</div></div></blockquote></div>"
